/- ========================================================================= -/
/- Transfer of homological definition of Brouwer degree to our Multivariate  -/
/- context, used to get some key results about homotopy of linear mappings   -/
/- and so all the usual things like Brouwer's fixed-point theorem.           -/
/- ========================================================================= -/
/- File: HolMultiLib/Degree.lean

  Original (c) Copyright, John Harrison 2017-2018.
  Lean4 translation by Chris Walton 2026

  A translation of HOL Light's `Multivariate/degree.ml`, in the style of
  HolMultiLib/Polytope.lean: pure, the proofs translated by hand, one `let` per
  OCaml `let`, in file order.  The load-time effects (`parse_as_infix`, the
  invariant lists) are at their file positions.  What degree.ml uses from
  earlier files is passed in `DegreeDeps`: everything polytope.ml already used
  comes in its `PolytopeDeps` (field `pt`), and the rest in the Q*Thms groups
  and the procedure field.  SessionMultiLib/Degree.lean supplies it.
-/

